+      "text": "Script ran on page and returned:\n```json\n{\"url\":\"https://webpromo.kinedu.com/aq-assessment?vid=c1991816-d75d-4e46-a05d-cc40924c2ea8&paywall=trial3&offer=p79-t7&newusers=1&placement=assessment-landing&utm_source=assessment-landing&utm_medium=partner&ui=classic&capture=0\",\"viewport\":{\"width\":390,\"height\":844},\"text\":\"🎉\\nThe reading is ready!\\n\\nTODAY'S PICTURE\\n\\nAt 12 months, Your baby is showing the skills of a typical 42+-month-old.\\n\\n✦ A lot is already in place, and new skills keep opening up.\\n\\nA “+” means they passed every question in that area: their level is above what these questions can reach, so the number is a floor, not a ceiling.\\n\\n→ faster\\n\\nThe green zone is what we usually see at 12 months. The dot is their reading.\\n\\n✓ This reading is already complete — unlocking adds depth by area, it doesn’t change the number.\\n\\nBY AREA\\n\\n🔒\\nPhysical\\naround 88\\nTap to unlock\\n🔒\\nCognitive\\naround 88\\nTap to unlock\\n🔒\\nLanguage\\naround 88\\nTap to unlock\\nSocial-Emot.\\nat least 40 months\\n\\n✨ Language looks like their strongest area — unlock the full profile to see all four.\\n\\nWHAT’S OPENING UP FOR YOUR BABY RIGHT NOW\\n\\nStops a rolling ball with hands or body.\\nMoves to the rhythm of music.\\n🔒\\nSays hello or goodbye with hand movements.\\n🔒\\n\\n+3 more in the full profile\\n\\nEvery child develops at their own pace. This helps you understand their unique journey — not compare them to others.\\n\\nDevelopment surveillance, not diagnosis.\\n\\nUnlock your baby’s full profile + daily activities →\\n\\n7 days free · no commitment\\n\\nTheir answers are already saved — it opens instantly.\",\"blurred\":[{\"text\":\"around 88\",\"filter\":\"blur(6px)\",\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"mt-1.5 select-none text-[15px] font-extrabold blur-[6px]\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(50, 175, 224); letter-spacing: -0.01em;\\\">around 88</div>\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"filter\":\"blur(3px)\",\"html\